<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Missing Proofs and Theorems</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proof of <a href="#S2.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 2.1 (Closed-Form Solution of Flow Matching ( ) ). ‣ 2.1 Closed-Form Flow Matching ‣ 2 Background ‣ A Long-Short Flow-Map Perspective for Drifting Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem 2.1</span></a></h3>

<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph"><a href="#S2.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 2.1 (Closed-Form Solution of Flow Matching ( ) ). ‣ 2.1 Closed-Form Flow Matching ‣ 2 Background ‣ A Long-Short Flow-Map Perspective for Drifting Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem 2.1</span></a>Closed-Form Solution of Flow Matching</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#S2.E3" title="Equation 3 ‣ 2.1 Closed-Form Flow Matching ‣ 2 Background ‣ A Long-Short Flow-Map Perspective for Drifting Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation 3</span></a> admits an optimal solution</p>
<table id="A1.E38" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}\!\big[u_{t}(x|x_{1})\big]=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[x_{1}]-x}{1-t}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}\!\big[u_{t}(x|x_{1})\big]=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[x_{1}]-x}{1-t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">which further admits a closed-form expression</p>
<table id="A1.E39" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E39X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle u_{t}^{*}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle u_{t}^{*}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1}}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}k_{t}(x_{1},x)]}{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1}}[k_{t}(x_{1},x)]},\qquad k_{t}(y,x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1}}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}k_{t}(x_{1},x)]}{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1}}[k_{t}(x_{1},x)]},\qquad k_{t}(y,x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39X.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=e^{-\frac{\|ty-x\|^{2}}{2(1-t)^{2}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=e^{-\frac{\|ty-x\|^{2}}{2(1-t)^{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Because the objective in <a href="#S2.E3" title="Equation 3 ‣ 2.1 Closed-Form Flow Matching ‣ 2 Background ‣ A Long-Short Flow-Map Perspective for Drifting Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation 3</span></a> is an <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> regression, the minimizer is given by the conditional expectation namely, <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}[u_{t}(x|x_{1})|x]=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[u_{t}(x|x_{1})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}[u_{t}(x|x_{1})|x]=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[u_{t}(x|x_{1})]</annotation></semantics></math>. Because <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x|x_{1})=\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x|x_{1})=\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[x_{1}]-x}{1-t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{*}(x)=\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]=\frac{\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[x_{1}]-x}{1-t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Expanding the expectation <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.E40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E40X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{x_{1}\sim p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)}[\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{1|t}(x_{1}|x)dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E40Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}\frac{p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})}{\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx}dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}\frac{p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})}{\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx}dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E40Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}}{\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}}{\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">We next compute <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>. For <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int\frac{x_{1}-x}{1-t}p_{t|1}(x|x_{1})p_{1}(x_{1})dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
