<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla\cdot u^{*}_{1^{-}}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∇</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla\cdot u^{*}_{1^{-}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
