<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E59Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overset{\textcircled{1}}{=}\int\frac{\int\phi_{j}(x_{1})p_{X_{1}|X_{t}}(x_{1}|x)dx_{1}-\phi_{j}(x)}{1-t}p_{x|z}(x|z)dx" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">①</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overset{\textcircled{1}}{=}\int\frac{\int\phi_{j}(x_{1})p_{X_{1}|X_{t}}(x_{1}|x)dx_{1}-\phi_{j}(x)}{1-t}p_{x|z}(x|z)dx</annotation></semantics></math></td>
