<p id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.7.1" class="ltx_text">When <math id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{j}(X_{t})=Z_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{j}(X_{t})=Z_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> can be used as the <math id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{t}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{t}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, namely <math id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{j}(X_{t})=Z_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{j}(X_{t})=Z_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
