<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20463v1/images/drifting_ablation.png" id="A2.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/179;" width="476" height="179" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span><span id="A2.F7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation study on feature-space optimization.</span> We compare three settings: using the default feature set with thousands of features (top), using only four features (middle), and operating directly in the original space (bottom).</figcaption>
</figure>
